249
00:09:17,965 --> 00:09:20,605
(There are tacos here too.)

250
00:09:21,635 --> 00:09:22,705
(She ends up returning to check the orders again.)

251
00:09:22,705 --> 00:09:23,735
Hold on a second.

252
00:09:23,735 --> 00:09:25,205
(She ends up returning to check the orders again.)

253
00:09:25,805 --> 00:09:27,815
(Thinking hard)

