265
00:09:56,405 --> 00:09:58,475
The beef burger will take a little longer. I'm sorry.

266
00:09:58,475 --> 00:09:59,775
- That's okay.
- That's okay.

267
00:10:00,005 --> 00:10:01,245
They just took their seats at the table.

268
00:10:01,475 --> 00:10:04,715
They wouldn't mind the wait if the food is delicious. It's okay.

269
00:10:05,285 --> 00:10:07,815
Young Ji, take your time and make it delicious.

270
00:10:08,015 --> 00:10:10,015
