- I brought it out.

273
00:10:16,595 --> 00:10:18,765
We need more than just one.

274
00:10:19,095 --> 00:10:21,735
- I'll bring more.
- Yes, thank you.

275
00:10:22,195 --> 00:10:24,035
Where can I find the burger trays?

276
00:10:24,465 --> 00:10:25,965
This is a burger tray.

277
00:10:26,205 --> 00:10:27,235
Shall I give you some burger trays?

278
00:10:27,235 --> 00:10:28,275
