- Table 6 and Table 14.

292
00:11:03,935 --> 00:11:06,775
- Table 6 and Table 14.
- Thank you, Mimi.

293
00:11:07,105 --> 00:11:08,575
Hello.

294
00:11:09,175 --> 00:11:10,815
I'm sorry. Your food is not ready yet.

295
00:11:10,815 --> 00:11:12,545
