2062
01:15:27,935 --> 01:15:30,105
Hello. This is it.

2063
01:15:30,265 --> 01:15:32,335
Table Six. What else?

2064
01:15:33,005 --> 01:15:34,675
This is very hot.

2065
01:15:35,275 --> 01:15:37,075
They sent me without anything.

2066
01:15:37,075 --> 01:15:38,945
