2067
01:15:39,015 --> 01:15:40,475
Please don't touch it. It's hot.

2068
01:15:40,475 --> 01:15:42,645
- Okay, thank you.
- Thank you.

2069
01:15:42,915 --> 01:15:44,385
Can I serve myself some Coke?

2070
01:15:44,385 --> 01:15:46,015
Yes, it's self-service.

2071
01:15:46,155 --> 01:15:48,455
