2072
01:15:48,625 --> 01:15:49,655
Over here,

2073
01:15:51,025 --> 01:15:52,855
you'll find Coke Zero and regular Coke.

2074
01:15:54,725 --> 01:15:55,795
Okay.

2075
01:15:55,795 --> 01:15:56,825
