2076
01:15:56,825 --> 01:15:59,135
- It's over here.
- Yes, you're right.

2077
01:15:59,465 --> 01:16:01,035
This is the place. I'm sorry.

2078
01:16:01,035 --> 01:16:02,705
(Embarrassed)

2079
01:16:03,365 --> 01:16:06,135
