2082
01:16:14,145 --> 01:16:15,515
Take it off.

2083
01:16:15,515 --> 01:16:17,585
Is it hot? Be careful.

2084
01:16:18,515 --> 01:16:20,615
No, I have to tear it off in one go.

2085
01:16:20,615 --> 01:16:21,825
"Tear it off?"

2086
01:16:22,625 --> 01:16:23,655
Tear it.

2087
01:16:23,655 --> 01:16:24,785
(She's way too concerned about Yu Jin.)

2088
01:16:25,095 --> 01:16:28,765
(Meanwhile, the tattoo artist is making ades.)

2089
01:16:28,765 --> 01:16:30,995
I don't think we can take orders of carrot cake anymore.

2090
01:16:31,125 --> 01:16:32,235
Okay, Eun Ji.

2091
01:16:32,395 --> 01:16:33,635
How many do we have left?

2092
01:16:34,665 --> 01:16:35,835
Twelve.

2093
01:16:36,105 --> 01:16:37,435
We have a lot left.

2094
01:16:37,965 --> 01:16:40,535
I wanted to say it beforehand in case you ask me to make more.

2095
01:16:40,975 --> 01:16:42,345
(She's quite ahead.)

2096
01:16:42,345 --> 01:16:43,445
Okay.

2097
01:16:44,945 --> 01:16:46,375
(At that time, new customers arrive.)

2098
01:16:46,375 --> 01:16:47,445
This place?

2099
01:16:49,885 --> 01:16:51,515
- Hello.
- Hello. Right now...

2100
01:16:51,515 --> 01:16:52,785
Is Yu Jin not here? I'll go out.

2101
01:16:52,785 --> 01:16:53,785
Yes?

2102
01:16:53,785 --> 01:16:54,785
(Proactive customer greeting)

2103
01:16:54,785 --> 01:16:56,055
- Do you have a reservation?
- Yes.

2104
01:16:56,055 --> 01:16:57,985
- One moment, please.
- You have a reservation?

2105
01:16:58,195 --> 01:17:01,695
(Disappointed by not getting many walk-in customers)

2106
01:17:01,825 --> 01:17:03,965
- Can I add another order?
- Yes.

2107
01:17:04,195 --> 01:17:06,295
One beef burger, one pizza,

2108
01:17:06,295 --> 01:17:08,335
one rice cake pasta, one tteokbokki,

2109
01:17:08,335 --> 01:17:10,865
one Chestnut Tyranno, two pomegranate ades,

2110
01:17:10,865 --> 01:17:11,975
and a cake.

2111
01:17:11,975 --> 01:17:13,205
- Okay.
- Yes, sir.

2112
01:17:13,405 --> 01:17:14,805
Eun Ji, can you serve that?

2113
01:17:15,845 --> 01:17:17,505
(However...)

2114
01:17:17,745 --> 01:17:20,445
(Another customer comes in.)

2115
01:17:20,445 --> 01:17:22,015
Do you have a reservation?

2116
01:17:22,685 --> 01:17:23,715
Actually...

2117
01:17:23,715 --> 01:17:25,585
- You don't have a reservation?
- No.

2118
01:17:26,185 --> 01:17:28,425
I'll take your order.

2119
01:17:28,425 --> 01:17:29,455
(A precious walk-in customer)

2120
01:17:29,455 --> 01:17:30,985
We have a walk-in customer.

2121
01:17:30,985 --> 01:17:32,095
(She comes back with her order.)

2122
01:17:32,095 --> 01:17:34,695
One yuzu ade and one beef burger.

2123
01:17:34,695 --> 01:17:35,965
- Okay.
- Gosh.

2124
01:17:35,965 --> 01:17:37,125
One yuzu ade and one beef burger?

2125
01:17:37,125 --> 01:17:38,125
(It's just 1 customer.)

2126
01:17:39,465 --> 01:17:42,635
(Middle-aged Man comes to clean up the dining area.)

2127
01:17:43,105 --> 01:17:44,565
(However...)

2128
01:17:45,305 --> 01:17:46,405
(The customers are busy on one side of the hall.)

2129
01:17:46,405 --> 01:17:48,675
It's okay for now.

2130
01:17:52,875 --> 01:17:54,045
Are you cleaning it...

2131
01:17:54,045 --> 01:17:55,185
- because it wasn't clean?
- Yes.

2132
01:17:55,645 --> 01:17:58,085
Wait. I'll clean it for you.

2133
01:17:58,085 --> 01:17:59,715
Our servers don't have the basics down.

2134
01:18:00,785 --> 01:18:02,285
One moment. I'll do it.

2135
01:18:04,055 --> 01:18:06,325
- All right. Please have a seat.
- Thank you.

2136
01:18:06,325 --> 01:18:07,355
(He scrambles to solve the problem.)

2137
01:18:10,925 --> 01:18:13,495
Do we have to ask for the dessert to be served?

2138
01:18:13,835 --> 01:18:15,335
That's not how it works here, right?

2139
01:18:15,335 --> 01:18:16,735
(They're questioning the ordering system.)

2140
01:18:16,965 --> 01:18:20,135
(The owner of the order that was thrown away)

2141
01:18:20,275 --> 01:18:23,405
Do we have to ask for the dessert to be served?

2142
01:18:23,875 --> 01:18:24,875
No.

2143
01:18:25,275 --> 01:18:26,915
It should be served when it's ready.

2144
01:18:26,915 --> 01:18:29,615
I'll go downstairs and put pressure on them.

2145
01:18:29,615 --> 01:18:30,915
Please wait a moment.

2146
01:18:31,445 --> 01:18:34,255
Table Two is asking why their dessert isn't served yet.

2147
01:18:34,755 --> 01:18:37,255
He asked politely yet firmly.

2148
01:18:38,055 --> 01:18:39,095
Just so you know.

2149
01:18:40,525 --> 01:18:42,265
(Table 2?)

2150
01:18:42,265 --> 01:18:43,725
(Dessert?)

2151
01:18:44,195 --> 01:18:46,135
Take your time. Let's check.

2152
01:18:46,135 --> 01:18:47,435
Everything will go out if we take our time.

2153
01:18:47,635 --> 01:18:49,105
We can do it. Hang in there.

2154
01:18:50,565 --> 01:18:53,535
It didn't go out to Table Two, but it's marked as yes.

2155
01:18:53,535 --> 01:18:55,245
Chestnut Tyranno didn't go out.

2156
01:18:55,245 --> 01:18:57,345
(When Yu Jin finally realizes it, )

2157
01:18:57,875 --> 01:19:00,645
(she hurries to make Chestnut Tyranno.)

2158
01:19:00,975 --> 01:19:03,615
(As it's late, she squeezes out a lot of chestnut cream.)

2159
01:19:03,945 --> 01:19:06,485
(Topping it with plump chestnut to finish)

2160
01:19:07,055 --> 01:19:09,355
Here's your dessert.

2161
01:19:09,355 --> 01:19:10,485
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

2162
01:19:10,485 --> 01:19:12,895
I'm sorry about that. Is there anything else that's missing?

2163
01:19:12,895 --> 01:19:14,425
- No.
- Thank you.

2164
01:19:14,425 --> 01:19:15,865
(1 Chestnut Tyranno at Table 2)

2165
01:19:16,325 --> 01:19:17,425
Is it good?

2166
01:19:18,065 --> 01:19:19,765
They made it exactly how I like it.

2167
01:19:19,935 --> 01:19:20,995
It's not very sweet.

2168
01:19:20,995 --> 01:19:22,865
(Thankfully, it was worth waiting for.)

2169
01:19:23,535 --> 01:19:26,705
(However, Eun Ji on the service team today...)

2170
01:19:26,705 --> 01:19:28,645
How many pomegranate ades do I have to make?

2171
01:19:29,405 --> 01:19:31,045
Hold on. I can't help but laugh.

2172
01:19:32,415 --> 01:19:34,775
Wait, none of the drinks went out.

2173
01:19:34,875 --> 01:19:36,985
Okay. Let's make five each.

2174
01:19:37,485 --> 01:19:41,255
(She starts to make a large amount of ade.)

2175
01:19:42,255 --> 01:19:43,985
Why isn't it boiling? What's going on?

2176
01:19:43,985 --> 01:19:45,195
(At that time, Mimi is making the rice cake pasta.)

2177
01:19:47,725 --> 01:19:49,665
I think we're out of gas.

2178
01:19:51,565 --> 01:19:53,195
Young Ji, can I use one of the stovetops?

2179
01:19:53,195 --> 01:19:54,435
- Where?
- The stove.

2180
01:19:54,565 --> 01:19:55,565
Okay.

2181
01:19:55,765 --> 01:19:58,165
(Moving to a new place for the time being)

2182
01:19:58,165 --> 01:19:59,505
I'll only use this.

2183
01:19:59,635 --> 01:20:01,945
- Sauce containers.
- There's no tray.

2184
01:20:01,945 --> 01:20:03,205
There's no sauce container at all.

2185
01:20:04,175 --> 01:20:07,745
(It's a small group, but walk-in customers are waiting.)

2186
01:20:08,385 --> 01:20:12,285
(They keep coming in, one after the other.)

2187
01:20:12,285 --> 01:20:13,515
We have an order.

2188
01:20:13,755 --> 01:20:15,485
We have another order.

2189
01:20:16,055 --> 01:20:17,325
The desserts are for Table Six.

2190
01:20:17,325 --> 01:20:19,795
(There are many dishes that must go out.)

2191
01:20:20,095 --> 01:20:23,365
(There's a mess to clean up in the dining area.)

2192
01:20:23,565 --> 01:20:26,135
(And in the kitchen...)

2193
01:20:26,135 --> 01:20:29,665
(Service Team's Order Status)

2194
01:20:29,665 --> 01:20:30,865
- Wait.
- Yuzu and...

2195
01:20:30,865 --> 01:20:32,035
Eun Ji.

2196
01:20:32,035 --> 01:20:33,305
(The service team checks the orders.)

2197
01:20:34,075 --> 01:20:35,375
Yuzu...

2198
01:20:36,105 --> 01:20:38,005
Four cups of yuzu ade and four cups of pomegranate ade.

2199
01:20:38,005 --> 01:20:39,145
Four cups of yuzu ade and four cups of pomegranate ade.

2200
01:20:39,145 --> 01:20:40,475
(She falls back into the ade inferno.)

2201
01:20:40,475 --> 01:20:41,885
Four cups of yuzu ade and four cups of pomegranate ade.

2202
01:20:43,215 --> 01:20:45,045
(Laughing)

2203
01:20:45,255 --> 01:20:48,425
(Piling up ade glasses)

2204
01:20:48,925 --> 01:20:49,985
Pomegranate.

2205
01:20:50,955 --> 01:20:52,055
Pomegranate.

2206
01:20:52,725 --> 01:20:53,795
Pomegranate.

2207
01:20:54,495 --> 01:20:55,565
Pomegranate.

2208
01:20:56,225 --> 01:21:00,735
(Meanwhile, Yu Jin gets ready to serve.)

2209
01:21:01,165 --> 01:21:04,805
(She goes out to serve Chestnut Tyranno first.)

2210
01:21:09,475 --> 01:21:11,605
(A chestnut escapes.)

2211
01:21:12,915 --> 01:21:14,045
I'm sorry.

2212
01:21:16,545 --> 01:21:19,185
(The Chestnut Tyranno collapsed.)

2213
01:21:20,985 --> 01:21:23,125
(Quietly, Yu Jin goes...)

2214
01:21:24,285 --> 01:21:26,655
(to pick up the chestnut.)

2215
01:21:27,125 --> 01:21:30,995
(She disposes it without a second thought.)

2216
01:21:31,465 --> 01:21:35,805
(She serves the tteokbokki first.)

2217
01:21:36,235 --> 01:21:38,475
(But something feels off.)

2218
01:21:38,475 --> 01:21:41,275
Did you get your table number?

2219
01:21:41,275 --> 01:21:43,145
- Is 14 our table number?
- That's right.

2220
01:21:43,145 --> 01:21:44,205
Thank you.

2221
01:21:44,205 --> 01:21:45,675
(Even the table number is missing.)

2222
01:21:46,275 --> 01:21:47,345
(She makes the urgent Chestnut Tyranno.)

2223
01:21:47,345 --> 01:21:48,745
Come out.

2224
01:21:49,545 --> 01:21:52,685
This is what chaos is

2225
01:21:53,085 --> 01:21:55,855
(At times like this, who can you count on?)

2226
01:21:55,885 --> 01:21:58,155
Service team, I'll help you once I'm done.

2227
01:21:58,155 --> 01:21:59,155
Okay.

2228
01:21:59,155 --> 01:22:00,295
- Mi Hyun.
- Yes?

2229
01:22:00,295 --> 01:22:01,655
- She probably doesn't know.
- Okay.

2230
01:22:01,655 --> 01:22:03,625
- You have to take a look.
- I already did.

2231
01:22:03,895 --> 01:22:06,165
(Actually, up until then, )

2232
01:22:06,695 --> 01:22:14,575
(the service team mostly helped out with the kitchen team.)

2233
01:22:14,735 --> 01:22:16,145
(But today...)

2234
01:22:16,405 --> 01:22:17,875
I'll go upstairs.

2235
01:22:17,875 --> 01:22:19,445
- I'd be grateful.
- Sure.

2236
01:22:19,445 --> 01:22:22,285
(It's time for the kitchen team to shine.)

2237
01:22:22,815 --> 01:22:25,185
Did I make you wait? I'm sorry.

2238
01:22:25,555 --> 01:22:26,585
(Serving the rice cake pasta that she made herself)

2239
01:22:26,585 --> 01:22:28,015
I wanted to make it delicious.

2240
01:22:28,385 --> 01:22:29,955
Enjoy your food.

2241
01:22:30,355 --> 01:22:32,095
Hello.

2242
01:22:32,095 --> 01:22:33,395
Where should we sit?

2243
01:22:33,525 --> 01:22:34,525
(I see.)

2244
01:22:34,525 --> 01:22:36,765
I'll clear it for you. Please wait.

2245
01:22:37,095 --> 01:22:38,365
Thank you.

2246
01:22:40,865 --> 01:22:42,765
Are you Table 14?

2247
01:22:42,835 --> 01:22:44,435
Here you go.

2248
01:22:44,435 --> 01:22:45,735
(She serves even without table numbers.)

2249
01:22:46,135 --> 01:22:48,875
Could you take it off? I'll clean your table.

2250
01:22:48,875 --> 01:22:49,945
